ps://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162997927,"discussion_id":"a3302ef27a138c9a98121a2e0df5ad4df19dc428","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n Zehai, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-02-12T10:36:24+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-12T10:36:24+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162997970,"discussion_id":"ad1b64c0625e632785e08a9038d6e411f4400a6c","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复三维卷积反向传播输入梯度计算内核中，在特定边界条件下（分组卷积的最后一组，且输入通道数无法被组内通道数整除）的核心索引计算逻辑错误。原代码在核心索引超出有效计算范围时直接返回，导致该核心后续的计算循环被跳过，可能影响计算结果的完整性和正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n将条件分支中的 `return` 语句修改为 `continue`。当核心索引超出有效尾部块索引时，不再直接退出当前函数，而是跳过当前循环的剩余部分，继续执行外层循环的下一次迭代。这确保了只有分配到有效数据块的核心才会执行计算，而超出范围的核心会正确地跳过无效任务，从而保证了所有有效计算块的正确执行，修复了边界条件下的计算流程。","created_at":"2026-02-12T10:36:32+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-12T10:36:32+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163015118,"discussion_id":"04191832ab1a4cac90e7c3b2710623d984824fb6","body":"/compile","created_at":"2026-02-12T11:33:08+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-12T11:33:08+08:00","user":{"id":"6752ba03b5b8bb7550ec8869","login":"Zehai","object_id":"6752ba03b5b8bb7550ec8869","name":"Zehai","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/ba/fb0b969a457e994c79e3d164e97d7724dcaaf946d